  "Five Finger Explosion": "",
  "Prep Time: Act 8\\nAll party members restore <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> SP, and Okyann obtains 3 stacks of <link=s|141><u>Rhythm</u></link>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>There's no one who wouldn't get into the rhythm under a spotlight. Give yourself up to the melody and feel the beat!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Gun damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy, with a 75% fixed chance to Target the enemy.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Bless damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies, and heals the ally with the lowest HP for $2 of ATK.": "",
  "Deals 3x $1 ATK Gun damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies, with $2 more damage and $3 more Critical Damage when Targeted enemies are on the field.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Curse damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies with a $2 base chance to grant the enemy a Curse DoT stack and gain $3 Fury.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Curse damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy. If there is only <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy on the field, gain 2 Fury.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Curse damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies. Damage dealt is increased by $2 on Extra Turns. If the target has any debuffs, this ability deals an additional $3 more damage.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Wind damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy with a 100% base chance to inflict Winded.": "",
  "Heals <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies for HP equal to $1 ATK + $2 and removes 1 Elemental Ailment from all allies.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Physical damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy. Critical rate is increased by $2, but hit rate is decreased by $3.": "",
  "Deals 4x $1 ATK Elec damage to <color=#FFFF00>random</color> enemies with a $2 base chance to Shock the primary target.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Elec damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy, and increases outgoing Elec damage from all teammates by $3 for $2 turns.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Elec damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies. If any enemy is Shocked, deals an additional $2 ATK damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Psy damage to <color=#FFFF00> all</color> enemies and grants 2 Green Leaves.": "",
  "<color=#FFFF00>Consumes 2 Green Leaves.</color>\\nIncreases <color=#FFFF00>1</color> ally's ATK by $1 of own ATK + $2 of Tomoko's ATK (up to $3) for 2 turns.": "",
  "<color=#FFFF00>Consumes 2 Green Leaves.</color>\\nHas a $1 base chance to inflict Sleep on <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy. Increases the enemy's damage taken by $2 if this Skill hits and by $3 if it misses.": "",
  "Deal $1 ATK Fire damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy with a $2 chance to inflict Burn.": "",
  "Heals <color=#FFFF00>1</color> ally for HP equal to $1 ATK + $2. If the ally's HP is less than $3, healing increases by $4.": "",
  "Heals <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies for HP equal to $1 ATK and increases the healing to the primary target ally by $2.": "",
  "Deals $2x $1 ATK Physical damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy. If your HP is over $3, this skill consumes an additional $4 HP and increases damage dealt by $5.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Electric damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies with a $2 base probability to inflict Shock. If Rebound is applied, this probability increases to $3.": "",
  "Waits, then deals $1 ATK Physical damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy on the following turn. If Rebound is applied, this skill will always deal Critical damage.": "",
  "Deals Fire damage equal to 19.3% of max HP to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy, with a 100% base chance to inflict Burn. If the target is Burned, this ability targets all enemies and grants 1 stack of Consecrator.": "",
  "Deals Fire damage equal to $1 of maximum HP to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies. Grants 2 stacks of Consecrator if an enemy is Burning, and inflicts Sanctified on Burning enemies.": "",
  "Deals Fire damage equal to $1 of maximum HP to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy, dealing $2 increased damage if the target is Sanctified.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy, dealing greater damage the lower the enemy's HP is. Increases up to a maximum of $3, when the enemy is below $2 HP.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy. If Ice Crystal has reached 10 stacks, damage increases up to $2 based on the enemy's lost HP.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies and has a $2 base chance to Freeze enemies.": "",
  "Deals $1 ATK Ice damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy and grants 4 Ice Crystals.": "",
  "Deals 4x $1 ATK Wind damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy with a $2 base chance each attack to inflict Winded.": "",
  "Deals 3x $1 ATK Wind damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> enemies, with a $2 base chance to gain Encouragement on each hit.": "",
  "Deals 3x 34.9% ATK Wind damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy, hitting an additional 1 time and increasing Critical chance by $2 if possessing 3 or more stacks of Encouragement.": "",
  "Deal $1 ATK Nuke damage to <color=#FFFF00>1</color> enemy, increasing damage dealt by $2 for each 1 stack of Boost on allies.": "",
  "Converts $1 of <color=#FFFF00>1</color> ally's current HP to Shield, gaining $2 + $3 Attack Damage and 1 stack of Boost.": "",
